[Music]  the track team was really just a big  family brothers and sisters and the  coaches are your parents keeping you in  line and we would travel together and  close to 40 hours a week together the  track team was very large I think we had  about 40 guy and the same amount of  women we travel to meet with 60 or 70  athletes we bring to a national meet we  brought probably 15 guys and 15 girls  yeah my relationship with Coach lundberg  was really strong he recruited me to  Hillsdale but he's a distance coach  cross country coach but we have a field  events coach who was going to be my  coach it's coached F and he's really the  one who was able to mold me into the  athlete that I became we spend a lot of  time together but there's a lot of trust  that has to happen I have to trust what  they're doing thank goodness coach test  had a lot of experience and he would  give me all the advice that I needed to  change my work outs or keep them the  same or change like staff so it was it  was a great working relationship because  these guys are so easy to get to know  easy to work with and they just love  everyone they work with as long as  you're willing to put in the work and  the time the success that I had as a  collegiate athlete was coupled with  failures as well the failures that I had  were mostly during the season trying  different things but it was an  experiment that coach test and I in  coach lundberg were working to figure  out what was going to be the best to  prepare me for the big dance which is  the National in my freshman year I was  just in the country in the high jump I  have eight times as an all-american I  feel like I represent the teams of the  early 90s we had a great string from 91  92 93 94 we lost the first year of the  GLIAC championship but we never lost  after that I represent coach test coach  coach Martha and I'm just the guy who  gets to get inducted for the whole thing  for them but I just feel like I'm their  representative

